  "about": "Reviewed allow-list of what the macOS blt-render-host may contain (packaging/verify_host_inventory_macos.py). It is compliance/host-inventory.json with one difference: the six phonemizer templates (arpasing_template, de_vccv_template, en_xsampa_template, envccv_template, filipino_template, german_template) are YAML text embedded as the checkout had them, and a Windows checkout turns line feeds into carriage return + line feed, so their size and hash differ (each by one byte per line) between the two builds. Generated by `verify_host_inventory_macos.py --write-expected` from the macOS build in CI; a reviewer confirms the six entries.",
